# Everything here is optional. The app runs with no configuration at all:
# `npm run dev`, then claim the site at /setup.

# --- Required only when deploying to a public URL ---
# Any long random string. The claim form asks for it, so a stranger who finds
# your site before you do cannot take ownership of it.
# OPB_SETUP_TOKEN=

# --- Storage ---
# Inferred from whichever backend's variables are present. Set this only to
# override that choice. Currently available: local
# OPB_ADAPTER=local

# --- The site's public URL ---
# Used for canonical links, Open Graph tags and the sitemap. Detected from the
# host when deployed; set it for local production builds.
# OPB_SITE_URL=https://example.com

# --- Optional: analytics (cookieless; nothing is recorded until set) ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=plausible
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN=example.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_WEBSITE_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_SRC=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_SHARE_URL=
